        <h2 class="studio-row__name">The Kanchli, reworked</h2>
        <p class="studio-row__copy">The Kutchi bodice cut for a modern silhouette, the mirror-work kept exactly as it has always been stitched. Sixty hours on the frame before a single seam is closed.</p>

        <ul class="studio-row__facts">
