        <p class="studio-row__copy">Suf is worked from the back of the cloth, counted thread by thread, with no pattern ever drawn. The embroiderer holds the whole geometry in her head.</p>

        <ul class="studio-row__facts">
          <li>Counted thread</li>
          <li>No pattern drawn</li>
